    "en": {
      "name": "Zenet Per Akh",
      "effect": "Add 1 \"Zenet\" monster from your Deck to your hand. If you discard a \"Zenet\" Ritual Monster(s) while this card is in your GY (except during the Damage Step): You can banish this card; Special Summon 1 non-Effect Fusion Monster from your Extra Deck with ATK less than or equal to any of the discarded monsters' as a Normal Monster Card, but for the rest of this turn, it cannot attack directly, also you cannot activate non-Zombie monster effects. You can only use each effect of \"Zenet Per Akh\" once per turn.",
      "official": false
    },
